    "preamble": "Moti Lal vs State on 5 July, 2017 Author: Chief Justice Bench: Chief Justice High Court Of Judicature For Rajasthan At Jodhpur S.B. Criminal Revision No. 511 / 1996 Moti Lal Son of Pukh Raj, By caste Khatri, Proprietor of M/s Ram Masala Udhyog, Samshan Road, Bhikya Pyaoo, Jodhpur Resident of Inside Sinwanchi Gate, Jodhpur. ----Petitioner Versus State of Rajasthan ----Respondent _____________________________________________________",
